            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plan prüfen, dann kopieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks on your organized library": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks on your organized library"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfungen deiner organisierten Mediathek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Folders": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Folders"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner auswählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder on a network share. For folders on this Mac, use Deduplicate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a folder on a network share. For folders on this Mac, use Deduplicate."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle einen Ordner auf einer Netzwerkfreigabe. Verwende für Ordner auf diesem Mac „Duplikate entfernen“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder on this Mac or an attached drive. Deduplicate can't move files on a network share to the Trash safely yet, so nothing was changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a folder on this Mac or an attached drive. Deduplicate can't move files on a network share to the Trash safely yet, so nothing was changed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle einen Ordner auf diesem Mac oder einem angeschlossenen Laufwerk. „Duplikate entfernen“ kann Dateien auf einer Netzwerkfreigabe noch nicht sicher in den Papierkorb legen. Deshalb wurde nichts geändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder on this Mac or an attached drive. Deduplicate can't move files on a network share to the Trash safely yet, so nothing was changed. For a NAS, use NAS Library.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a folder on this Mac or an attached drive. Deduplicate can't move files on a network share to the Trash safely yet, so nothing was changed. For a NAS, use NAS Library."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle einen Ordner auf diesem Mac oder einem angeschlossenen Laufwerk. „Duplikate entfernen“ kann Dateien auf einer Netzwerkfreigabe noch nicht sicher in den Papierkorb legen. Deshalb wurde nichts geändert. Verwende für ein NAS „NAS-Mediathek“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose both a source folder and a destination folder before starting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose both a source folder and a destination folder before starting."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige tanto una carpeta de origen como una de destino antes de comenzar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez à la fois un dossier source et un dossier de destination avant de démarrer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle vor dem Start sowohl einen Quellordner als auch einen Zielordner aus."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始する前に、ソースフォルダーとデスティネーションフォルダーの両方を選択してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在开始之前，请同时选择源文件夹和目标文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli sia una cartella sorgente sia una cartella di destinazione prima di iniziare."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha tanto uma pasta de origem quanto uma de destino antes de iniciar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chronoframe can't use this folder. Choose a regular folder on a network share, not a link. Nothing was changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe can't use this folder. Choose a regular folder on a network share, not a link. Nothing was changed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe kann diesen Ordner nicht verwenden. Wähle einen regulären Ordner auf einer Netzwerkfreigabe statt eines Links. Es wurde nichts geändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chronoframe copied this file but could not verify the copy, so the destination copy was removed and the source was left untouched. Source: %@. Destination: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe copied this file but could not verify the copy, so the destination copy was removed and the source was left untouched. Source: %@. Destination: %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe copió este archivo pero no pudo verificar la copia, por lo que la copia de destino fue eliminada y el origen no fue modificado. Origen: %@. Destino: %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe a copié ce fichier mais n'a pas pu vérifier la copie. La copie de destination a donc été supprimée et la source n'a pas été modifiée. Source : %@. Destination : %@."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe hat diese Datei kopiert, konnte die Kopie aber nicht überprüfen. Die Zielkopie wurde entfernt und die Quelle blieb unangetastet. Quelle: %@. Ziel: %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframeはこのファイルをコピーしましたが、コピーを検証できなかったため、コピー先が削除され、元ファイルは変更されませんでした。コピー元: %@。コピー先: %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe 复制了此文件但无法验证副本，因此目标副本已删除，源文件保持不变。源：%@。目标：%@。"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe ha copiato questo file ma non ha potuto verificare la copia, quindi la copia di destinazione è stata rimossa e la sorgente è stata lasciata intatta. Sorgente: %@. Destinazione: %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Chronoframe copiou este arquivo, mas não pôde verificar a cópia, portanto, a cópia de destino foi removida e a origem não foi modificada. Origem: %@. Destino: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chronoframe could not check this file, so it skipped it. File: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe could not check this file, so it skipped it. File: %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe no pudo verificar este archivo, por lo que lo omitió. Archivo: %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe n'a pas pu vérifier ce fichier. Il a donc été ignoré. Fichier : %@."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe konnte diese Datei nicht überprüfen und hat sie übersprungen. Datei: %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframeはこのファイルを確認できなかったため、スキップしました。ファイル: %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe 无法检查此文件，因此已跳过它。文件：%@。"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
