    "%@ file from an earlier copy that was interrupted is still waiting. Start copying to resume or discard them, then try the free test batch. Nothing was copied and your originals were not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ file from an earlier copy that was interrupted is still waiting. Start copying to resume or discard them, then try the free test batch. Nothing was copied and your originals were not changed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ Datei aus einem früheren, unterbrochenen Kopiervorgang wartet noch. Starte das Kopieren, um sie fortzusetzen oder zu verwerfen, und führe danach den kostenlosen Testlauf aus. Es wurde nichts kopiert und deine Originale wurden nicht verändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ files from an earlier copy that was interrupted are still waiting. Start copying to resume or discard them, then try the free test batch. Nothing was copied and your originals were not changed.": {
