    "Chronoframe could not read its record of how much of the free trial you have used, so it cannot show what is left. Unlocking Chronoframe removes the limit entirely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe could not read its record of how much of the free trial you have used, so it cannot show what is left. Unlocking Chronoframe removes the limit entirely."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chronoframe konnte die Daten zu deiner bisherigen kostenlosen Nutzung nicht lesen und kann deshalb das verbleibende Kontingent nicht anzeigen. Mit der Freischaltung entfällt die Begrenzung vollständig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your free allowance is used up. Unlock Chronoframe to keep organizing.": {
